              "html": "<p>Ре­ши­те не­ра­вен­ство <span data-inline-latex=\"7^{-\\left|x-3\\right|}\\cdot \\log_2 (6x-x^{2}-7)\\ge 1\"></span>.</p>",
              "title": "Условие",
              "asset_keys": []
            },
            "operation": "rewrite",
